    {
      "slug": "fluentprovider",
      "status": "implemented",
      "widgets": [
        "FluentApp",
        "FluentThemeOverride"
      ],
      "themes": [
        "FluentTheme"
      ],
      "reference": "flutter-foundations.md",
      "notes": [
        "Route transitions ignore reduced motion. `FluentApp` installs `FluentPageRoute` as its `pageRouteBuilder`, and that route's `buildTransitions` always fades and slides \u2014 nothing in `app.dart` reads `MediaQuery.disableAnimationsOf`. Every named-route navigation therefore animates even when the platform asks for reduced motion, against this skill's own motion rule. Widget-level motion is unaffected; the gap is the route transition alone."
      ]
    },
